/=  core  /lib/jibb/primitives

::  Representation for agent and in-process store pokes.
::  The prelude re-exports this mold; effect lowering and the runtime must
::  agree on these cells when effect execution is implemented.
+$ poke
  [%agent agent=@tas mark=@tas payload=*]
  [%store module=@t action=@tas payload=*]

::  The compiler supplies this private interface; execution is not yet implemented.
++ gth-atom |= args=[A A] (raw-gth.core args)
